			"Message": "fix(Common): Update telemetry app identifier to FIDDEE and correct markdown syntax\n\nAlign the PostHog telemetry implementation in `Source/Telemetry/CaptureEvent.rs` with the current project branding by updating the `$app` identifier from \"land-editor\" to \"fiddee\". This ensures accurate event grouping in analytics.\n\nSimultaneously, correct the `README.md` header by replacing the HTML entity `&amp;` with the standard `&` in the \"Funding & Acknowledgements\" section for proper rendering.\n\nThese changes ensure telemetry data correctly attributes to the FIDDEE project while maintaining documentation clarity.",
